[10.271231, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[1;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[49m \u001b[39m\u001b[2mDecision provider failed. Check the selected provider's credentials and availability in Pi.\u001b[22;39m                                                          \u001b[49m\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[2;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[49m                                                                                                                                                      \u001b[49m\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[3;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[4;1H\u001b[2K The single \u001b[38;5;5mopenai_decide\u001b[39m call failed: check the selected provider’s credentials and availability in Pi.                                              \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[5;1H\u001b[2K                                                                                                                                                      \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[6;1H\u001b[2K No typed answers were returned:                                                                                                                      \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[7;1H\u001b[2K \u001b[38;5;5m- \u001b[39m\u001b[1mroute (choice):\u001b[22m unavailable                                                                                                                        \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[8;1H\u001b[2K \u001b[38;5;5m- \u001b[39m\u001b[1mready (bool):\u001b[22m unavailable                                                                                                                          \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[9;1H\u001b[2K \u001b[38;5;5m- \u001b[39m\u001b[1mrisk (score 1–5):\u001b[22m unavailable                                                                                                                      \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[10;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[12;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[49m \u001b[39mThe classifier is already selected with /openai-decisions. Call openai_decide exactly once with state {\"change\":\"README typo fix\",\"tests\":\"pass\"}    \u001b[49m\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[13;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[49m and questions: route (choice: review or proceed), ready (bool), risk (score 1-5). Then list the typed answers.                                       \u001b[49m\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[14;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[49m                                                                                                                                                      \u001b[49m\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[15;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[17;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[49m \u001b[39m\u001b[1mopenai_decide\u001b[22m\u001b[39m \u001b[39m\u001b[2mstate={\"change\":\"README typo fix\",\"tests\":\"pass\"} questions={\"route\":{\"type\":\"choice\",\"instructio...\u001b[22;39m                                   \u001b[49m\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[18;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[49m \u001b[39m\u001b[2mDecisions are disabled. Select a native classifier with /openai-decisions use provider/model to opt in.\u001b[22;39m                                              \u001b[49m\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[19;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[49m                                                                                                                                                      \u001b[49m\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[20;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[21;1H\u001b[2K The single \u001b[38;5;5mopenai_decide\u001b[39m call reported that decisions are disabled. No typed answers were returned:                                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[22;1H\u001b[2K                                                                                                                                                      \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[23;1H\u001b[2K \u001b[38;5;5m- \u001b[39m\u001b[1mroute (choice):\u001b[22m unavailable                                                           